
=== NEW ACCOUNTS REQUIRE STAFF APPROVAL ===

Your account has been created, but a staff member has to approve it
before you can finish character creation and enter the game.

What happens next:
  - Your account name, and the email address you gave if you gave one,
    appear on the staff approval queue.
  - A staff member reviews it. Approvals are done by hand, so this is
    not instant.
  - Once approved, log in again and continue where you left off. Your
    account and password are already saved.

If you were not asked for an email address and want to be reachable
about the approval, mention it when you log in and a staff member can
record one for you.

Nothing further is required from you right now. Log in again later to
check whether the approval has gone through.
